/-
  `O`-version of the §12-type totally separated design (q = 19, the 27 rows of degrees 4..12), at the EDGE
  `t = t₃ = 8.88860881…`, the real root of `f(t) = 140777t⁴ − 4043858t³ + 35443487t² − 89056524t − 47598822`
  in `(8.8885, 8.889)` (see `CMHodgeDesignThresholdT3.lean`).  `t₃` is irrational (degree 4), so this is the design
  problem with the twist `t` extended to a real parameter (the rows are polynomial in `t`); the lattice pieces are
  those of `O = Z[θ]`, θ³ + θ² − 6θ − 7 = 0, as in the rational-`t` files.

  Namespace `DesignT3Point`.
    * `f_lo_pos`, `f_hi_neg`: `f` changes sign on the rational bracket `[tlo, thi]` (width 10⁻⁴⁰).
      ASSUMPTION used below: `t` is a root of `f` in that bracket (`hf : f t = 0`, `ht₁`, `ht₂`).
    * `k1 … k5`: the coefficients `c₁₀₀, c₁₁₀, c₁₁₁, c₂₁₀, c₂₁₁` of the tangent point `q*` as cubic polynomials in `t`
      (`c₀ = c₂₀₀ = c₂₂₀ = c₂₂₂ = 0`, `c₂₂₁ = −1`); `k_bounds` (assumption: `t` in the bracket): rational enclosures;
      `k_rel` (assumption: `f t = 0`): `k5² = −4·k4` (the face binary form is a perfect square).
    * `dqc_neg_shift` (generic coefficients `c`; assumptions: the rational box on `c`, `c5² = −4c4`, `d ≥ 0`, the other
      five coordinates `> 0`): `Δq_c(80 + d, …) < 0`.  Proof: 4 exact face squares `x_L² x_S (x_A + ¾x_O − c5/2)²`,
      81 rational squares, 124 leftover monomials whose coefficients are affine in `c` and `≥ 0` on the box
      (`b₂`-coefficient `> 0`), and `linear_combination` with the relation.
    * `dqs_neg_of_some_coord_ge` (assumptions: `f t = 0`, `t` in the bracket, six coordinates `> 0`, one `≥ 80`):
      `Δq*_t < 0`.
    * `qs_mem` (assumption `f t = 0`), `V_mem`, `p0_mem`: `q*, V, p₀ ∈ T_t` as explicit `Σ_j g(u_j)·h_j`,
      `g(x) = (x − t)² + 19`.
    * `no_design_at_root` (ASSUMPTION `hbox`: every piece with all six coordinates `≤ 80` has `Δq* < 0`, or
      `Δq* = 0` and `ΔV < 0` — checked outside Lean on B_80: 121,752,610 pairs up to the Galois action, exactly one
      zero, the family `P₂ = (−2−θ+θ², 23+3θ−3θ²)` with `ΔV = −342`; plus `f t = 0`, `t` in the bracket, positive
      coordinates, nonnegative weights, the design equations for `q*`, `V`, `p₀`): `False`.
  The dictionary "design ⟺ `Σ n Δp = p(0)` for all `p ∈ T_t`" (earlier notes, on paper) is not formalised here.
-/
